# BUG-680: a member CsvTable, CsvWriter or HttpResponse does not have is refused in the front
# end, naming the real ones. Before the fix each line below passed `-c`; the three method
# calls failed inside zig, and `t.rows` COMPILED -- `_CsvTable` has a Zig field `rows`, so it
# handed back the runtime's raw slices. One refusal per line; the smoke registers each.

def main()
    var t = Csv.parse("a,b\n1,2\n")
    print(t.rowCnt())
    print(t.rows)
    var w = CsvWriter()
    print(w.bild())
    var r = HttpResponse.new(201, "made")
    print(r.body)
    print(r.withHeadr("a", "b"))
    var cv = DateTime.of(2024, 3, 15).inCalendar(Calendar.Gregorian)
    print(cv.yeer)
    var pool = ThreadPool(2)
    pool.wiat()
